WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
Hello! Hi...

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.160
It's been four years and I still don't know how to introduce myself on a vlog.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.820
But Hello! How's it going? I'm here because I want to say words.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.740
And words is the only thing that I know how to do good- apparently not...

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.600
God dammit!

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.580
Okay, so I wanted to make a video because I wanted to talk to you guys

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.180
about some thoughts that I've been having about YouTube.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:27.140
Because just a few days ago it was actually the four year anniversary that I've been on YouTube.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.420
It's four years ago that I started posting videos,

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.740
and four years ago that my life totally changed,

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.740
and became all about YouTube.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.140
And the only thing that I have the right to talk about is things that are in my immediate bubble,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.840
And my bubble is very small,

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.320
but my bubble involves YouTube.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.360
I don't want to talk about international politics or bullshit like that,

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.480
But I do know YouTube because I live YouTube.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:55.720
I experience YouTube everyday. I wake up and think about YouTube.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.940
I wake up and think about the videos that I was supposed to make the day before

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.300
but I was too lazy to make

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.660
And then I gotta make them that day and then I gotta hurry up and get ahead of my schedule.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.000
I know YouTube.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.720
And I love doing YouTube. I love making videos for you guys.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:09.220
it's -- it's

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:13.700
Literally the purpose that I have put my life to.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.660
And that is good.

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:19.480
Because it gives me something that I am motivated for.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.480
It gives me something that pushes me forward and higher,

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:25.020
and makes me a better person.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.880
And also, it puts food on the table so that I'm not starving.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.400
So, this all combines into something that is very important to me.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.720
YouTube is my Life.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.940
YouTube is everything that I do,

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:43.420
It's literally the only priority that I have in my daily life.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.260
And that's because I love doing it.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:46.800
And

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.060
I love doing it ...

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:54.280
and then that makes me self-reflect on what YouTube is turning into.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.240
YouTube has changed over the years, many times.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.300
YouTube has changed over the years, many times. It's changed leaderships,

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.660
IT'S CHANGED DESIGN DECISIONS.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.240
Sorry.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.740
New people have come in, old people have left.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:09.940
People have moved around, you guys have changed your tastes.

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:11.840
But what I see...

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.640
from doing this for four years is what I can only describe...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.080
And I took a lot of time thinking about these words,

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:21.200
is...

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.020
a self-fulfilling cycle of pessimism.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.980
And that's a big phrase for Markimoo to say but...

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:34.080
That is the only way that I can describe what I see every day.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:37.140
And what I mean by self-fulfilling

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:37.640
Self...

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:38.980
Pffff what did I even say?

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:39.760
I don't even know

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:45.000
What I say by the 'vicious cycle of pessimism' is what I'm going to call it now,

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.200
someone quote me on that,

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:51.040
is that when people are doing YouTube, they are after a few things.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.920
And you can't fault them for it because of course people would want to do this for the living, but...

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:59.380
They're after 1) Influence 2) More Viewers 3) and Money.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.020
And that's fine!

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:01.520
You kno- you

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.020
I -

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:02.520
I am --

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:06.960
I would be a hypocrite if I said I would do this for free because I couldn't

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:14.760
and I wouldn't, because it's part of my income and it's how I live, so of course I want to do it -- It's my job.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.520
But I don't treat it as my job but it is my job.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:21.440
So I'm hypocritical if I was to criticize anyone for going after YouTube for money.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:22.760
And that's not what I'm doing.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:26.860
Because even YouTube the business -- If you asked an executive at YouTube they would go -

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.700
"We want more views, more money, more ad revenue, and"

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.340
"MORE MORE MORE MORE MORE"

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:36.640
And you can't exactly fault them for that; It's the nature of the business of things.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:44.020
But what I know, being at the heart of YouTube and being where I am now from where I started, I've seen...

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.160
this change in attitude.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.440
And...

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:53.700
It's very subtle and it's hard to see, but it's definitely there.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:04:00.840
It's a change from seeing YouTube as a platform where anyone can do anything

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:04.180
and anyone can put up whatever they want whenever they want...

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:08.700
To a system where you have to follow strict rules.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.840
You have to follow strict protocols.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.700
You have to criticize others.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.700
It's every man for himself,

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.700
and no one can cooperate!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.380
And I'm not saying it's bombastic "that's what it is"

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.640
but that's what it is starting to be.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.680
Because as more and more people try to flood in the system,

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:29.140
the more and more people try to hold *tight* onto what they have and they don't want to let go.

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.560
And I can't fault for that eizer! (either)

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:36.220
Like, they worked hard to make their YouTube channels and they worked hard to make something,

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:39.780
and so they-they want to attack others and they want to cause drama

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.540
and they want to make things happen.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.460
And I'm not naming names here. This is a general sense.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.540
I'm never gonna name names on this;

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.340
I have way too much respect for too many people to start calling people out

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:53.020
and doing exactly what I'm saying is happening.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.400
But it &gt;is&lt; happening.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:59.760
And it's a self-fulfilling cycle of pessimism because people want more.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.060
And then MORE people want more.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.780
And then the people want other people to have less.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.720
Because they want more!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.900
And then now MORE people want more.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.940
And then more people want others to have less.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:17.160
And it's becoming less of a community about making cool videos for you guys,

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:20.060
Which is what it &gt;ALWAYS&lt; has been about.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:24.600
It ALWAYS should about! It should be about you guys and you guys alone.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:29.100
And you guys actually have the power in this system.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.180
Because it's a weird democratic process.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.740
If you guys watch a video, obviously there is a demand for that video.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:39.120
People are gonna make more of that type of video and you guys get what you want.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.420
If you guys don't watch a video, then obviously that video isn't going to do as well

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.420
and not as many people are gonna want to make that type of video.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.020
And that's fine!

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.380
That's how it works!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.040
That's how you guys have the power --

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:51.580
and tha -- cah

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.000
How you guys shape what YouTube is.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:00.740
The only thing that I have wrong with it is that it stifles creativity for the sake of creativity.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.820
And I'm-I'm like,

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.560
I'm guilty in this too because I do the same thing!

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.000
Like, I make videos because...

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.080
people want to see them. And I do that...

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:15.220
And so that is the thought that I had recently was....

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.120
Why do I do this?

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:19.340
I do it because I love it, right?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.600
That should be the answer.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.220
Like, I do! Yes, of course!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.140
And it is the answer, but at the same time ...

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.820
I felt like this...

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.700
pang of shame.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:34.540
Y'know, this sense in my mind that I was almost ashamed of what it's become.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:37.020
And I'm not, but I felt it.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.200
And ... it-it dawned on me.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:48.780
That I had more fun making a video where I stared at a banana for five minutes

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:53.480
and then 1.7 MILLION people watched it!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:57.420
Ah, by the way, I didn't make those subtitles, the subtitles are open to you guys.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.100
You guys make the thumbnai --

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.280
you guys mae--

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.040
YOU GUYS MADE THAT BETTER!

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:07.140
You guys made it better from the subtitles. That was soooo cool and soooo fun.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:09.900
And THAT'S what I love about YouTube.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.700
Like, you can put up ANYTHING!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.520
ANYONE can put up anything!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.600
And that's great! And that's wonderful!

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:22.180
Anyone can put up absolutely anything, but that's happening less and less.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.620
On my part, too.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.300
Like I said, I'm guilty.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:29.760
I'm hypocritical for criticizing anyone for doing this because I'm guilty too.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.700
I've made videos, you know, just because people wanna see more of 'em!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.320
And, there's nothing wrong with that, but it's,

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:41.660
leading down to a road where that's all that's ever going to happen.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:47.660
Instead of trying to surprise you guys with new and interesting things-

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.900
and sometimes very stupid things, like me staring at a banana for five minutes

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.280
or eating a bowl of cereal for five minutes...

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.180
It's...

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.260
Y'know...

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.760
It-it's moments like that, that I look back on my channel.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:04.360
Y'know, I don't look back at like, part 13 of a Let's Play that I did 3 years ago,

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:05.880
I look back at...

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:07.880
'The Fall of Slenderman'.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.600
I look back at...

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.100
Like, uh... 'Jumpscare Friends'.

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.460
I look back at...

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.340
[Laughs]

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.340
'Markiplier's Magic Touch'.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:21.020
I look back at those, y'know I think about the Impossible Let's Plays,

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.420
th-the WEIRD things that I've done,

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:25.600
the- the April Fools' jokes that I've done.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.060
I think back to those...

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.060
And I love those.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.640
Those are cherished memories in my heart...

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.600
And they're always gonna be there!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.100
Always!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.900
And that's what I wanna see more out of YouTube,

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.980
and that's what we're NOT seeing more of out of YouTube.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.440
I mean, I'm not saying it's not happening, it's definitely happening,

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:49.780
but in smaller and smaller quantities as years go by.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:51.900
So...

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:57.000
If-if you guys are looking for a point to this video, I don't even know if I can wrap it up in one sentence.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.860
But the point that I'm trying to make, or that at least I'll try to halfway get to making,

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:02.480
is that...

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:06.140
YouTube is changing into a system that...

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:10.080
is only rewarding for more views and more money.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:13.480
And it's been that way for a long time, and me-

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:17.800
It's easy for me to say it's not a good thing because I'm obviously sitting

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:21.220
high up on the YouTube rung and people looked to me for advice,

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:25.420
I'm like 'Wah, I don't know what I'm doing, why are you talking to me?'

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.100
And so...

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.260
Like, who am I to say,

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.600
what one thing is or another?

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.420
But these are the observations that I make.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:38.320
And me, being someone that loves to watch YouTube videos and loves to see these cool things...

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.840
I don't want it to turn into a constant money mill.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:45.040
And I don't want to make sure it doesn't do that either! Because...

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.840
I love making videos for you guys.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.680
I LOVE making videos for you guys.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.680
I love it with all my heart.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.100
I love doing the weird things so much!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.480
You guys don't understand how much I LOVE doing these things!

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.000
And I care about it.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:07.060
I care about YouTube, I care about what people make on YouTube.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.220
And it sickens me.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:13.240
To see some of the bullshit that comes out

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:17.520
of the stupid cycle of pessimism,

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:21.700
that ever-turning wheel of 'I'm better than you'!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:23.880
And that sucks.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.380
And I don't know how to fix it.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.220
I really don't.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.220
Because I don't think I can.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:31.400
But I know that you guys can.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:36.680
And I KNOW that you guys can because you guys are the ones that are in control of literally everything-

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:41.720
We are slaves to you guys! Like, we, the YouTube creators.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:46.360
We are... like, indebted to you for everything that we have

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:50.460
and I always try to maintain that sense of gratitude to you guys.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:55.320
Because I am so grateful for what you guys have done to change my life,

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.080
and change the world in what we've done, you know,

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.300
and all the charity efforts.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.860
But expanding beyond just me...

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.420
Like, you guys are in control of everything.

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.460
And I love you guys for that.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:13.040
And I love what we do together, and I love everything about YouTube.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:17.660
And I just don't want to see it down a dark road.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:22.400
And AGAIN, I'm not being apocalyptic, I'm not trying to 'fight the system',

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:25.360
I'm just saying thoughts that I have had...

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.880
Given my 'expertise'...

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.200
on YouTube.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:35.520
So, I don't think I made a single point in this entire video,

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.720
I think I just rambled for way too long,

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:42.560
but those are my feelings about what it means...

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.220
to make videos on YouTube. And what it means...

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:50.040
to owe something to you guys, and what it means...

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.800
to do things... for the sake of having fun.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.500
And make things because no one asked them to be made.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.720
No one WANTED it to be made. [chuckles]

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.700
But it was made anyway, and it was wonderful.

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:10.320
And that's the beauty of what YouTube... is.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:11.880
And hopefully will be.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.200
So anyway, I'll stop rambling. That-that's pretty much all I wanted to say.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:23.420
If-if anyone wants to try to stitch a coherent paragraph out of everything that I just rambled about,

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:24.540
FEEL FREE!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.980
Go to town on it, maybe I'll put it in the description. But...

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.220
You know, just...

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:33.760
In the end, thank you guys for letting me be stupid.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.060
In front of millions of people!

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.660
So, thanks again everybody so much for watching.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.800
And as always, I will see YOU

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.300
in the next video!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.360
Buh-bye!

